// PHASE B MIRROR REPAIR (backend-switch audit, 2026-07-28)
// Prisma counterparts for Airtable tables that previously had no model.
// Intra-Airtable drift note: CHANGE_LOG is the canonical variations table
// (PlatConVariationOrder); the older VARIATIONS Core table is superseded and
